{"id":"2bb30c9adea2e6f3eeef84a815bdba4853716704","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232286","title":"用 AI 写代码的时候，是否会发现它时而 [特别强大] ，时而 [特别蠢]","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"liushuang","excerpt":"程序员 - @liushuang -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/性能\"><li></li> 性能</a></P><p><span>6 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-06 16:50:44 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944348\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64e2/6a06/199603_normal.png?m=1741594861\" alt=\"383394544\" data-uid=\"199603\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/383394544\">383394544</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 13:20:25 +08:00\">3h 39m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>四个字：约束优先。好的事前约束（ <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://AGENTS.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">AGENTS.md</a> 、schema 规范、api 规范、开发流规范[例如要求模型动手前先看代码库、事后用别的 cli review 等]）都能降低模型被带到沟里的概率，还有他在干活时你得盯着，一看不对劲赶紧让他停。模型遇到对的方向就强，错的方向就坑。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17945640\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5c6305a99335f422fdc5153c16511ec0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zqguo\" data-uid=\"313188\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zqguo